# Route: guide 47 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 18 quests, 6.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Felwood, Tirisfal Glades, Stranglethorn Vale): Emerald Sanctuary ->
# Jaedenar -> The Bulwark -> Booty Bay -> Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound -> Zuuldaia
# Ruins.
